Key Responsibilities:

• Team Leadership and Management: Directly manages Account Directors within the division and oversees the pod of Account Managers assigned to the Account Directors. Leads by example and fosters a positive work environment centered around Power Digital’s core values and instilling a growth mindset, providing value not only to clients through strategic insight, but also to internal team members through mentorship, resources and personal development. Demonstrates impartial leadership and gives equitable support and opportunities across all team members. Ensures that all team members receive clear direction, regular goal alignment, and proactive support to be successful in their role. Serve as the coach within account teams and the division by practicing radical candor and delivering timely, actionable feedback to team members to up-level their performance and propel their career development. Lead team training initiatives, including developing and delivering training on new processes, tools, and strategies to enhance team activation output and client results.

